fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} 
** The {{M|projectile}} has a {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Wave of Terror basic1}}/{{#var:Wave of Terror value1}} round2}}-second travel time to max distance.
** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}} 
*** Grants a 4-second {{#var:Wave of Terror basic2}}-radius [[flying vision]] as the [[projectile]] travels.
*** {{hi|Vengeful Spirit}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 Pto.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 toP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]]
**** The vision radius starts at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] onward.
***** {{Code|OP {{=}} {{#var:Wave of Terror basic3}}}}
***** {{Code|PQ {{=}} MaxTravelDistance}}
** Hence, the ability has the following values:
*** The vision range reaches up to {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Wave of Terror basic2}}+{{#var:Wave of Terror value1}}+{{#var:Wave of Terror basic3}}}}-distance away.
*** The projectile affects enemy units up to {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Wave of Terror value1}}+{{#var:Wave of Terror value2}}}}-distance away, with both the max travel distance and effect radius.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|vengefulspirit_wave_of_terror}}
** Reapplying the debuff updates its ability values and refreshes its duration.
** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||steal reduced armor and damage|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3l}} does not update the current active debuff instance.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Reduces the affected targets' {{M|main attack damage|text=main}} and {{M|bonus attack damage}}.
**** Does not affect bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}}.
**** Stacks additively with other total attack damage reduction sources.
**** Does not affect the following units:
***** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|vengefulspirit_wave_of_terror_buff}}
**** Grants the following bonuses per debuff-affected enemy unit.
***** Partial amount of reduced armor as flat {{calc|v1*{{#var:Wave of Terror type1 value1}}|v1={{#var:Wave of Terror value4}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Wave of Terror type1 value1}}|v1={{#var:Wave of Terror value4 tal}}}}|15tal}}) {{M|bonus armor}}.
***** Partial amount of reduced attack damage as flat {{M|main attack damage}}, equal to {{calc|v1*{{#var:Wave of Terror type1 value1}}|v1={{#var:Wave of Terror value5}}|%}} of each debuff-affected unit's attack damage.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Wave of Terror icon0}}
| desc = Vengeful Spirit lets loose a wicked cry, weakening the total attack damage and armor of enemies, and giving vision of the path ahead.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Wave of Terror basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**# The {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|vengefulspirit_wave_of_terror}}.
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|vengefulspirit_wave_of_terror_buff}}.

