{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Nether Swap
| desc = Swaps position with the secondary target, upon casting on the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit, with the following sequence:<br><br>Shen {{to}} primary target; Primary target {{to}} secondary target; Secondary target {{to}} Shen.
}}

 * Issues a stop order as soon as Shen and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit {{M|teleports}} back.
** Hence, it interrupts {{M|channeling}} abilities.
** The teleport component is not affected by {{M|leash}} sources.
*** Neither {{M|disjoint}} {{M|projectiles}} for both affected units.
*** {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** [[Trees]] within 300-radius centered around both affected units are destroyed upon cast.

* Applies the following ability effects on the affected units:
: {{{!}} class="wikitable" style="text-align:center; margin:0; font-size:80%;"
{{!}}-
! style="width:100px;" {{!}} Unit
! style="width:100px;" {{!}} Ability Effects
{{!}}-
{{!}} {{Symbol|Target|Unit|size=17px}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy|size=17px}}
{{!}} {{Symbol|Damage|Magical|size=17px}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage|size=17px}}
{{!}}-
{{!}} {{Symbol|Target|Unit|size=17px}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally|size=17px}}
{{!}} {{Symbol|bonus db-all|size=17px}}
{{!}}-
{{!}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self|size=17px}}
{{!}} {{Symbol|bonus db-all|size=17px}}
{{!}}}

* Both the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} value and {{M|damage barrier}} value are independent of each other.

* Cannot be cast on the following units.
** {{M|Disable Help}} on Shen prevents Nether Swap from swapping the allied hero.
** {{M|Hidden}} units.
** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Nether Swap icon0}}
| desc = Instantaneously swaps positions with a target Hero, friend or enemy. Nether Swap interrupts channeling abilities on the target. Enemy Swapped units take damage. Vengeful Spirit and allied swapped units gain a barrier equal to the damage dealt.
}}
{{Barriercard}}

